        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Tin Cup Challenge: ACT Foundation</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/50855.webp" alt="Tin Cup Challenge: ACT Foundation" loading="lazy">
        </div>

        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <p>ACT Foundation grew from an idea a few years ago. After watching my kids raise funds to perform an after-school play, I knew someone&nbsp;needed to help the community bring performance art back into the spotlight. After a couple of&nbsp;years and a career change, that someone was me. My passion for dressing up and my love of the arts led to this adventure. I had no idea it would have such a positive impact on our Valley. I am grateful&nbsp;for the support &#8211; it takes a village!</p>

<p><em>“ACT Foundation and Milissa West have provided such a valuable and much-needed outlet in our community for aspiring actors of all ages &#8211; from bringing back the beloved tradition of the Christmas Carol to making summer community musicals a reality to bringing Missoula Children’s Theater and acting workshops to our little valley.  Her investment in our community will grow theater and empower kids (and adults) with a creative outlet that builds confidence and passion. My daughter has already been a huge beneficiary of this amazing new organization driven by a passionate mom.  Thank you, ACT Foundation!”     (Iris Saxer, local mom)</em></p>

<p><em>&#8220;ACT Foundation is the BEST”   (Zinnia Saxer, actor, 9) </em></p>
        </div>

